01:20:38.646 --> 01:20:43.026
DM: Yeah, it's just the sort of looking around the oa- l- like thinking about

01:20:44.106 --> 01:20:50.486
DM: exploring the oasis and kind of looking a- about looking, sort of trying to understand the geology of it

01:20:51.546 --> 01:20:54.506
