01:43:55.736 --> 01:43:56.096
Unknown: Yeah?

01:43:59.016 --> 01:43:59.516
Unknown: Have you been there,

01:44:00.686 --> 01:44:00.755
Unknown: Alf?

01:44:00.756 --> 01:44:02.516
Delwath: I had occasion to-

