01:45:29.296 --> 01:45:29.636
DM: Um,

01:45:30.936 --> 01:45:34.316
DM: as you approach, uh, I guess make, um-

01:45:37.136 --> 01:45:37.516
Unknown: Perception

01:45:37.516 --> 01:45:39.876
DM: ... dead bodies, I'll say investigate.

01:45:39.876 --> 01:45:41.696
