01:45:43.136 --> 01:45:44.336
Unknown: Medicine.

01:45:44.336 --> 01:45:44.616
DM: Okay.

01:45:45.756 --> 01:45:47.256
Delwath: Oh, my D&D Beyond.

01:45:47.256 --> 01:45:47.996
Unknown: Hold on a second.

01:45:49.796 --> 01:45:50.096
Unknown: My medicine.

01:45:50.096 --> 01:45:50.716
DM: Um.

01:45:50.716 --> 01:45:54.196
Wellby: Sure thing.

01:45:54.196 --> 01:45:55.796
Kenzo: Why is it not letting me make a medicine check?

01:45:57.096 --> 01:45:57.896
Unknown: Oh, there it is.

01:46:08.816 --> 01:46:10.916
Unknown: Investigation.

01:46:10.916 --> 01:46:13.676
Kenzo: Let's all remember to talk about that ruined city later.

01:46:13.676 --> 01:46:14.896
Unknown: Mm-hmm.

01:46:14.896 --> 01:46:16.616
DM: Um, so, um,

01:46:19.696 --> 01:46:21.336
DM: uh, Delwath, you, uh,

01:46:22.576 --> 01:46:27.185
