01:46:44.756 --> 01:46:46.696
DM: a, a day or two dead.

01:46:46.696 --> 01:46:51.156
DM: It's hard to say exactly, but, you know, not a few hours and not weeks.

01:46:51.156 --> 01:46:52.276
Unknown: Mm-hmm.

01:46:52.276 --> 01:46:55.416
Delwath: So plausibly, they were killed by the same lizards.

01:46:55.416 --> 01:46:58.256
DM: Yes. Plausibly, they would have been killed by the same lizards.

01:47:02.576 --> 01:47:05.776
Delwath: You're smiling evilly, like something's gonna happen.

01:47:05.776 --> 01:47:08.836
DM: Sometimes I just do that to keep you on your toes.

01:47:08.836 --> 01:47:09.616
