01:47:17.096 --> 01:47:24.336
DM: There's, like, uh, you know, entrails scattered about, but very little flesh left, um, on most of them.

01:47:24.336 --> 01:47:28.636
DM: Uh, there's a couple that are just rotting that seem to be not, um,

01:47:30.476 --> 01:47:39.296
