01:47:46.736 --> 01:47:49.796
Kenzo: They look almost like they're killed for sport, I ask to the group.

01:47:50.956 --> 01:47:51.776
Unknown: Could be.

01:47:51.776 --> 01:47:53.176
Wellby: Yeah, could be.

01:47:53.176 --> 01:47:54.616
Unknown: No, um, giant feathers, are there?

01:47:56.215 --> 01:47:57.436
DM: No giant feathers.

01:47:57.436 --> 01:47:57.796
Unknown: Damn.

01:47:59.736 --> 01:48:01.936
