01:48:20.896 --> 01:48:23.236
Kenzo: Alf, tell us more about these, these ruins,

01:48:24.336 --> 01:48:26.456
Unknown: city.

01:48:28.496 --> 01:48:32.836
Delwath: I, I don't know much more than they exist, to be honest.

01:48:35.116 --> 01:48:35.676
Unknown: Hmm.

01:48:35.676 --> 01:48:37.096
Delwath: When I was here

01:48:38.636 --> 01:48:42.216
