01:48:51.456 --> 01:48:51.636
Unknown: Hmm.

01:48:53.056 --> 01:48:57.016
Kenzo: When you were here before, before, or before?

01:48:59.016 --> 01:49:00.416
Delwath: It was recently.

01:49:00.416 --> 01:49:01.516
Delwath: Um, I,

01:49:03.076 --> 01:49:04.936
Delwath: I came to this region, uh...

01:49:07.896 --> 01:49:11.656
Delwath: When I arrived in this region from elsewhere,

01:49:12.936 --> 01:49:15.216
Delwath: it was near this ruined city.

01:49:15.216 --> 01:49:15.396
Unknown: Hmm.

01:49:16.456 --> 01:49:16.615
Unknown: Elsewhere?

01:49:16.616 --> 01:49:18.096
