01:49:23.826 --> 01:49:23.856
Delwath: But I-

01:49:23.856 --> 01:49:25.436
Delwath: ... have no way of knowing.

01:49:25.436 --> 01:49:26.956
Delwath: No, I mean, did-

01:49:26.956 --> 01:49:26.976
DM: You weren't-

01:49:26.976 --> 01:49:30.936
Delwath: But I have n- I guess I wasn't, I wasn't well enough traveled to have known.

01:49:30.936 --> 01:49:34.516
