01:50:06.708 --> 01:50:07.518
Unknown: [laughs]

01:50:07.518 --> 01:50:09.428
Wellby: How long have you ever gone from one place to another?

01:50:13.368 --> 01:50:13.708
Unknown: [laughs] Uh.

01:50:15.048 --> 01:50:16.677
DM: Well, sometimes,

01:50:17.748 --> 01:50:18.168
DM: uh,

01:50:19.188 --> 01:50:20.868
