01:51:10.308 --> 01:51:11.308
Wellby: Were you reliving it?

01:51:19.668 --> 01:51:21.128
DM: You know, it's, it's hard to know.

01:51:24.788 --> 01:51:29.548
Delwath: Hmm. It was, it was a, it was an odd place, almost like a shadow of this world.

01:51:31.568 --> 01:51:32.828
DM: Vast and shadowy.

01:51:34.608 --> 01:51:35.728
DM: Nothing quite real.

01:51:37.848 --> 01:51:40.748
Delwath: I think nightmare may be the best term I can think of.

01:51:45.348 --> 01:51:45.688
DM: Hmm.

01:51:53.468 --> 01:51:55.428
DM: As you continue

01:51:57.028 --> 01:52:00.468
