01:52:36.828 --> 01:52:37.008
DM: Um,

01:52:38.388 --> 01:52:41.948
DM: the road just kind of ends on the edge of this cliff, um,

01:52:43.048 --> 01:52:53.088
DM: looking down, uh, hundreds of feet, um, into the down path talus slopes and, and into the drastic die bottom of this,

01:52:53.088 --> 01:52:55.948
