01:52:55.948 --> 01:52:56.748
DM: And you feel,

01:52:58.328 --> 01:53:04.278
DM: staring across this canyon, that there is something different about the world beyond, that this is,

01:53:05.288 --> 01:53:06.768
DM: this is not just stepping,

01:53:07.808 --> 01:53:11.048
DM: um, you know, this... On the other side of this canyon is not just, um,

01:53:12.188 --> 01:53:15.088
DM: more of the same. It's, this is the true wilds.

01:53:15.088 --> 01:53:19.068
DM: This is the cursed lands of the, of the Great War.

01:53:19.068 --> 01:53:22.508
DM: This is, this is the Blasted Plains.

01:53:22.508 --> 01:53:23.108
DM: And it's, uh,

01:53:24.528 --> 01:53:28.188
DM: you know, staring across, contemplating this, it's, it's a,

01:53:29.248 --> 01:53:32.988
DM: it's something, it's something different and new and, and more than you've,

01:53:34.228 --> 01:53:34.348
DM: uh,

01:53:35.588 --> 01:53:39.708
DM: something wilder than you've, than you've seen before in your travels.

01:53:39.708 --> 01:53:39.758
DM: Um-

01:53:40.828 --> 01:53:45.218
Seeker: D- Sorry, go ahead. Does it remind me of, um, that thing

01:53:47.848 --> 01:53:48.848
DM: that I, that I found

01:53:50.368 --> 01:53:50.868
