01:54:16.328 --> 01:54:16.548
DM: Um,

01:54:19.528 --> 01:54:20.288
DM: uh.

01:54:21.648 --> 01:54:23.848
Kenzo: Willis doesn't like the change in music.

01:54:23.848 --> 01:54:24.628
Unknown: [laughs]

01:54:24.628 --> 01:54:29.148
Delwath: I'm fine. Ca- I mean, is the, is crossing the canyon feasible?

