Delwath: Like, is it, are we coming to the edge of it and we have to go down?

01:54:33.168 --> 01:54:35.507
DM: Or is... Like, I'm just trying to picture it.

01:54:35.508 --> 01:54:36.468
DM: Um,

01:54:37.428 --> 01:54:42.648
DM: uh, yes, you, well, it, it extends, um, north-south

01:54:43.728 --> 01:54:45.108
