01:54:45.108 --> 01:54:52.618
DM: Um, it certainly looks like it, it might be, you know, it's, it's not a straight drop 800 feet down.

01:54:52.618 --> 01:54:56.447
DM: Right. So you could probably descend with some care.

01:54:56.448 --> 01:54:56.628
DM: Um,

01:54:58.408 --> 01:55:00.168
DM: the land to the south, uh,

01:55:01.388 --> 01:55:11.768
DM: you know, if you were to go along the edge, um, seems like it quickly turns into this, you know, chaotic, uh, twisted tunnels of canyons and badlands.

