DM: Um,

01:56:16.920 --> 01:56:18.119
DM: you know, some kind of,

01:56:19.380 --> 01:56:20.000
DM: uh,

01:56:21.020 --> 01:56:22.900
DM: some sort of ruined, um,

01:56:25.180 --> 01:56:27.640
