02:00:26.260 --> 02:00:27.290
Unknown: 19.

02:00:27.290 --> 02:00:37.190
DM: Okay. So you, you begin picking your way down the cliff, and, and, um, you know, it's, the descent is not too bad for the first 400 feet or so.

02:00:37.190 --> 02:00:46.560
DM: It, um, you know, you manage to, to sort of navigate, um, a path and, and sort of pick your way down the slope.

02:00:46.560 --> 02:00:52.480
