02:02:52.152 --> 02:02:54.492
DM: [laughs]

02:02:55.772 --> 02:02:57.812
Seeker: I'm just explaining all of this as we pass by.

02:03:00.112 --> 02:03:01.232
Unknown: And do you, uh, see my note?

02:03:02.712 --> 02:03:03.292
DM: Uh,

02:03:05.932 --> 02:03:06.331
DM: yes.

02:03:07.392 --> 02:03:07.832
DM: Um...

02:03:13.652 --> 02:03:15.952
Seeker: What do you all think explains the phenomenon here?

02:03:15.952 --> 02:03:17.832
