02:03:20.052 --> 02:03:23.972
Seeker: It's, uh, this is clearly not, uh, a natural erosion process.

02:03:25.312 --> 02:03:27.132
Seeker: That much, that much seems obvious.

02:03:33.692 --> 02:03:34.742
DM: Um, so it's now maybe,

02:03:36.012 --> 02:03:36.352
DM: uh,

02:03:37.772 --> 02:03:39.202
DM: 40 minutes till sunset.

02:03:39.202 --> 02:03:44.312
DM: The sun is sort of just touching the horizon, and you're at the top of 100-foot cliff.

02:03:46.112 --> 02:03:47.532
Seeker: We're at the top of it? Oh.

02:03:47.532 --> 02:03:48.832
Wellby: Let's head back up and make camp.

