02:11:03.520 --> 02:11:03.880
Seeker: Mm-hmm.

02:11:05.500 --> 02:11:06.880
Seeker: Before the hyenas.

02:11:08.660 --> 02:11:09.400
Wellby: Interesting.

02:11:11.300 --> 02:11:11.420
Seeker: Hmm.

02:11:12.510 --> 02:11:14.220
Wellby: Definitely before the hyenas.

